/morehouse-parish"],["ARC or PLC in Morehouse Parish","/arc-plc/louisiana/morehouse-parish"],["PRF calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 11 grids came in under 90% of normal in October to November 38 times in the 75 years since 1951, the most of any pair. In 2025 on the middle, April to May ran 165% of normal and November to December just 47%. In 2026 so far on the middle, January to February came in at 51% and February to March at 45%. Grid 15154 had its driest year in 2010 at 57% of normal.</p>"}
